# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Competition data — NEVER commit. The source archive is ~265 GB and the
# extracted DICOM tree is of the same order. GitHub's hard limit is 100 MB per
# file, and even Git LFS is not appropriate at this scale.
# Data is obtained from Kaggle; see DATASET.md for the download/extract steps.
